<<~ ahu #/entry>>

! The Lares-Corpus ~ the palace, instantiated ephemeral over any corpus

''One-line:'' the memory-palace machina reads as a ''sensorium-for-FORM'', generalized — and this meme
states how `lares corpus` stands one EPHEMERALLY over any text or code corpus, learns that corpus's own
grammar blind, and dissolves it on exit.

The palace already carries the move. The living-grammar palace
([[living-grammar-palace|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/api/living-grammar-palace#/palace-instance]]) names a nameless palace-entity that
ACTS AS a `compose_palace(caps)` — a `#has` cap-stack ([[has-stack|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/has-stack]])
projecting three planes off one verbatim drawer (content · structure · form). The lares-corpus
''instantiates that same entity transiently'' over a target path: the schema lifts out of the palace via
the cap-stack, runs against borrowed text, and reaps itself. Identity rides the address
([[loci|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/loci]]), never a stored essence — so a scratch palace carries the
full machina without owning a durable home.

''The three planes split by what they hold:''

<<~ranks plane structure ~ ALREADY corpus-general — content-FREE shape vectors; the structurepalace encoder reads any tree -> content ~ STOCK — the nomic embedder over the verbatim words; off-the-shelf -> form ~ the NEW ground — the corpus's OWN grammar, neither shipped nor stock, INDUCED from the corpus and named LAST>>

''The keel holds the whole move.'' The composition acts as a functor or it carries no meaning
([[functor-discipline|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/functor-discipline]], //mālama pili// — keep the arrows): the
ephemeral palace projects the SAME three views the durable palace does, on a borrowed corpus, under one
discipline. The unification's product-presheaf spine
([[living-grammar-palace|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/api/living-grammar-palace#/unification]]) governs the join here exactly as it
governs the durable store — the corpus palace is that object read three ways, transiently.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-cli>>

!! The CLI ~ five organs, one enumerator, help that teaches

''Keep the dep-free arg-walker.'' No heavy framework enters the
operator surface ([[lares-bin|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/cli/bin/lares]]); the binary holds NO domain logic and
dispatches thin async handlers. Stricli (or any router) enters ONLY if ever mandated — the web2 smell test
holds the line.

''SETUP wires ALL FIVE organs through ONE shared registry.'' The teardown command already resolves its
targets explicitly, never ambient ([[palace-teardown|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/cli/commands/palace-teardown]] —
`resolveTargets()`). Lift that enumerator into ONE shared `palaceOrgans()` — ''one enumerator, two''
''consumers'': `setup` and `teardown` read the SAME organ list, so the wire-up and the sweep can never
drift. The organ ladder wires dependency-ordered:

<<~ranks organ mempalace ~ FIRST — the worldline-KG lives INSIDE it; everything keys to the verbatim drawer -> structurepalace ~ structure plane; any order after mempalace -> formpalace ~ form plane; any order after mempalace -> corpus-scratch ~ the ephemeral 4th instance home (~/.lares/.corpus/); any order -> meshpalace ~ LAST — federation rides over the local planes once they stand>>

`setup` runs ''wire-once / detect-existing'' (idempotent — an already-stood organ no-ops), returns the
`PalaceSetupStep[]` ledger as a table or JSON, and surfaces through:

<<~ranks surface wake-init ~ `lares vessel stand --init` (EXTEND the existing wake) -> status-palaces ~ `lares vessel read --palaces` (probe every organ's standing)>>

''The help that teaches.'' Add a per-command ''HELP REGISTRY'' — each command carries
`{ synopsis, examples[], flags[] }`, examples-first. This registry
IS the heleuma-anchored surface (#/the-gate): the help text the operator reads and the meme prose stand as
ONE canon, and the audit trips when they drift.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/lares-corpus>>

!! `lares corpus` ~ the ephemeral noun-verb tree

The lifecycle models three battle-proven idioms: ''`docker run''
''--rm`'' (run-then-reap), ''nix-shell'' ephemeral environments (a derived env that exists for the duration),
and ''mktemp + trap EXIT'' (the scratch dir guaranteed-swept on success OR error). The noun-verb tree:

```
\procedure ~Verb(Type:"" Params:"") ~Verb <<Type>> holds [{{{ [<Params>] }}}]
```

<<~Verb run "args/<path> [-- <analysis>] ~ EPHEMERAL-DEFAULT: open→ingest→analyze→DISSOLVE; `--keep` lands it durable">>
<<~Verb open "args/<path> [--name] ~ stand a scratch palace, hold it open for queries">>
<<~Verb query "args/<id> <kw> ~ ask an open scratch palace">>
<<~Verb ls "args/ ~ list the live scratch instances">>
<<~Verb keep "args/<id> ~ EXPLICIT promote — land a scratch palace into the durable store">>
<<~Verb dissolve "args/<id | --all | --orphans> ~ idempotent reap + orphan-reaping">>
<<~Verb help "args/ ~ examples-first cheat from the help registry">>

!!! The lifecycle law

Each ephemeral palace stands as a ''scratch instance under''
''`~/.lares/.corpus/<id>/`'' — a ''4th mempalace instance'' beside the structurepalace (2nd) and formpalace (3rd)
the teardown already names ([[palace-teardown|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/cli/commands/palace-teardown]]).
Resolved-never-ambient, sweepable. Three holds bind it:

<<~ranks law ephemeral-by-default ~ `run` reaps on exit unless `--keep` lands it -> keep-explicit ~ durability NEVER happens by accident; the operator promotes -> trap-EXIT ~ dissolve fires on success OR error; an interrupted run leaves no half-paved scratch>>

''The sweep registration closes the leak.'' Register `~/.lares/.corpus/*` into the teardown
`palaceOrgans()` enumerator (#/the-cli) — so an interrupted run that the trap missed (SIGKILL, a crashed
host) still falls to `lares palace-teardown`, which reaps every orphaned scratch home. Ephemeral state can
never leak past two independent reapers (the trap AND the sweep).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-caps>>

!! The Caps ~ what the cap-stack projects (mostly already-solved)

Four of the five caps stand on built or stock ground; one
(form) carries the research:

```
\procedure ~Cap(Type:"" Params:"") ~Cap <<Type>> holds [{{{ [<Params>] }}}]
```

<<~Cap content "stock/the nomic embedder over verbatim words ~ off-the-shelf, no new work">>
<<~Cap structure "ALREADY-SOLVED/our content-free structurepalace encoder + a tree-sitter parse-ROUTER (code · markdown · wikitext · json → one CST API; prose fallback → benepar/Stanza constituency); BONUS: a thin tree-sitter grammar for our own `<<~…>>` sigils (~1 file, high value)" >>
<<~Cap bands "the GRAIN + the BOUNDARY tree ~ #the-bands below — the FFZ membership-tree address (a prefix code, li) + ecp::e.divisive's nested changepoint tree (ki, boundary), cosine-drift the signal">>
<<~Cap form "the INDUCTION STACK ~ #the-form-induction below — the research-grade half">>
<<~Cap coupling "the BASE cap that glues sub-sensoria ~ the directed child↔child flow read ON DEMAND through the H¹ cohomological gate (fuse when H¹=0, hold-open when H¹≠0 — never a silent average); empty for a single frozen corpus, present as the plane">>

''The structure plane is the cheap win.'' The structurepalace already encodes content-free shape vectors — it
reads any tree. The new work is a ''parse-ROUTER'': route code/markdown/wikitext/json through tree-sitter
into one CST API; fall prose back to a constituency parser (benepar or Stanza). The sigil grammar (a thin
tree-sitter grammar for `<<~…>>`) earns its bits by making the house's OWN corpus first-class to its own
sensorium.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-bands>>

!! The Grain + the Boundary Tree ~ a membership address, not a frequency

''The aperture ladder reads as a membership TREE, never a''
''frequency decomposition.'' The five bands ([[noosphere-boot|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/noosphere-boot#/law-of-5s]] —
Pulse · Beat · Measure · Arc · Theme) name grain-LEVELS of a containment path — WHICH theme, which arc,
which measure — a stored prefix code (the FFZ address, [[ffz-clock|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/ffz-clock#/the-spine]]),
li not ki. What a band never names is HOW MANY ticks: a band counted in ticks IS a count, and a bandpass
reporting where energy concentrates answers a different question than a change-point reporting where the
generating regime turns over — a category error, retired
([[sensorium-machina|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/sensorium-machina#/ki]]). The organ rides two layers
plus a gate:

!!! 1 — the GRAIN (the FFZ membership address, li)

<<~ranks grain-level Pulse ~ the finest cell -> Beat -> Measure -> Arc -> Theme ~ the coarsest>>

The address is a ''containment PATH read as an ultrametric'',
ORDER-FREE, prefix-free at each level — so it prices itself in BITS and FOLDS INTO the two-part code
(`ffz_address.address_bits`), never sitting beside it. Coarsening = truncation. A band MAY read null and
the address truncates cleanly; a band that could not go null would be a counter, and a counter manufactures
a global now.

!!! 2 — the BOUNDARY tree (ecp::e.divisive, ki)

The band-membership tree rides ''`ecp::e.divisive`'' (R,
nonparametric) — ''MULTIVARIATE'' over content + form + structure, which IS our three-plane quorum
([[living-grammar-palace|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/api/living-grammar-palace#/unification]]) read in the
changepoint domain; ''divisive'' = native-nested, so the tree falls out of the algorithm — coarse cuts
parenting fine, which IS the membership tree, handed over for free. The ''per-chunk cosine-drift'' over
content embeddings reads as the boundary signal — //Measure = cosine-drop// — a regime-turn read, never a
wavelet band.

!!! The reproduction gate ~ Liminal RESOLVED

Liminal's old worry — does an adaptive boundary-finder ever converge, or
chase forever — RESOLVES on ''RESAMPLING-CONSENSUS'': lock a boundary as Canon ONLY where a bootstrap /
jackknife reproduces it (an un-witnessed boundary NEVER reads reproduced). That gate IS our confidence
register made statistical — Canon-vs-Provisional becomes does-the-resample-reproduce-it, witnessed against
the baseline corpus (#/baseline-corpus) before it locks Canon.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-form-induction>>

!! The Form-Induction ~ the research-grade half (miners surface, the LLM names LAST)

The form cap carries the genuine research. The corpus's own grammar
emerges from a mining stack, iterated EM-style, stopped by description-length — and the LLM stays OUT of
the loop until the mining settles.

<<~ranks miner treeminer ~ frequent EMBEDDED subtree templates — the structural constructions -> prefixspan-bide ~ move-SEQUENCES — the temporal/ordered constructions -> c2xg ~ usage-based CONSTRUCTICON induction (ΔP association) — the on-target nameless learner>>

''The stop is MDL.'' A mined template survives only if it PAYS
ITS OWN description-length — minimize `l(G) + l(D|G)` (grammar bits + data-given-grammar bits); a template
that does not shrink the encoding gets REJECTED. Backed by held-out likelihood and a min-support floor.
This is our existing MDL stop lifted from recall into grammar.

''SEED-AND-REFINE is safe BECAUSE of MDL.'' Seeding the miners with a
prior is sound precisely because MDL discards any seed that fails to earn its bits — the floor catches a
bad seed, so the seed cannot smuggle a fabricated grammar past the encoding.

''The LLM names LAST.'' The LLM enters ONLY to label and merge
AFTER the miners surface the templates — never inside the induction loop. That ordering honors the
house's nameless discipline (don't name-then-hunt): the miners find the shape blind, the LLM hangs a name
on what already proved itself by description-length.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-resonances>>

!! The Resonances ~ the house was right again

The research did not invent the architecture — it found the
house's existing moves already standing in the statistical literature. Each cap lands on a pattern the
house already held:

<<~ranks resonance aperture-ladder ~ = the grain tree (Pulse→Theme as containment LEVELS, not a frequency decomposition) -> boundary ~ = ecp multivariate changepoint tree (content + form + structure) -> register ~ Canon-vs-Provisional = the resampling-consensus gate (bootstrap reproduces → Canon) -> mdl-stop ~ = our existing MDL lifted to grammar (a template pays its bits) -> nameless-discipline ~ = miners surface, the LLM names LAST (don't name-then-hunt)>>

The originality lives in the ''weave'', never in any single strand — the same braid the unification
keystone names ([[living-grammar-palace|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/api/living-grammar-palace#/unification]]).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-dial-findings>>

!! The λ-dial, measured ~ what the plane-wise ablation returned

Six controlled instruments ran the dial over the Kumulipo corpora — ablation, placebo square, shape-cell,
λ-dial, line-rhythm, continuous pour — every finding double-controlled, several predictions failed and
reported as failed. What follows carries the readings, not the session that took them.

!!! The cliff at λ=1 ~ a first-order transition, not a slope

''The design predicted a slope; a discontinuity arrived.'' Struct-form disagreement should have slid
smoothly as the dial turned; the data shows a jump the instant λ leaves 1. The physics vocabulary fits: a
smooth slide reads as a second-order transition, and this resembles ''symmetry breaking over a degenerate
ground state''. The red metric holds three classes with zero within-class energy — every member of a class
ranked identically, a pencil balanced on its tip. Any perturbation, however small (λ = 0.999), collapses
the degeneracy and the system falls into the black channel's ordering.

''The envelope's dominance holds on a measure-zero slice of dial-space'' — structurally unstable, dominant
only under literal monopoly. A reading that treats the wrapped corpus as the normal case mistakes a knife
edge for a plateau.

!!! The carrier wave ~ Shannon's corollary, walked into by design

''A perfectly predictable signal carries zero discriminative information.'' The red channel's engineered
regularity — the same sigil grammar wrapping every section — makes it, in radio terms, a ''carrier wave'':
strong, constant, and informationless for telling sections apart. The moment any modulated signal enters
the mixture — the black channel, the chant, which varies — it carries all the discrimination.

''So the wrapping never blew the other entities out by force. It saturated the metric into TIES, and ties
surrender to the first non-tie.'' The house canon said it early and this measures it: //the black speaks,
the red steers//. The red channel steers — it picks the parser, it addresses, it classifies — while
carrying almost no within-corpus discriminative content. Exactly what a classifier register should do, and
now witnessed doing it.

''The design lesson:'' the notation behaves as a proper ''determinative system'' in the Egyptological sense
the classifier-channel doctrine already cites — category-marks that steer without sounding. The dial turns
that into a choice of instrument: λ=1 studies the determinatives, λ=0 studies what they determine.

!!! What the two ends of the dial buy

* ''λ=1'' — senses the envelope. The right instrument for studying the notation itself.
* ''λ=0'' — reproduces full extraction ''without extracting'' (structure ρ = 0.9982). Any nonzero weight on
the bare channel breaks every tie at once.
* ''Structure, wrapped'' — DECKARD centrality over router parse-trees reads ρ 1.000 in both modes: both
corpora parse into the sigil grammar as identical envelopes, identical trees. The measurement reads the
annotation's own shape, so a discovery made over wrapped ground reads as a machine admiring its folder.

!!! Sequenced meaning ~ Frege in the embedding space

The shape-placebo moved content salience nearly as far as the meaning-placebo (0.70/0.64 against
0.74/0.63): ''scrambling word order costs the content plane about as much as replacing the words with
babble''. Three domains converge on why, and the decomposition they yield carries the reuse.

* ''Compositional semantics'' — Frege's principle: sentence meaning composes through structure, not through
a bag of word-meanings. An embedder that drops about equally under shuffle and babble reads compositions
rather than inventories; a bag-of-words model would have shrugged at the shuffle.
* ''The transformer lineage'' — word order enters the vector by architecture. The measurement prices that
inheritance on real data: roughly ''two-thirds of salience ordering rides lexicon alone'' (the babble
floor), and most of the remaining third rides order, with ordered-lexicon contributing the sliver between
shuffle (0.70) and babble (0.74).
* ''Distributional semantics' own creed'' — shuffling destroys the contexts and with them the meaning,
though every word survives.

''The sliver running small carries the finding itself.'' At section grain the "semantic" plane functions
mostly as a syntax-sensitive lexicon reader. Any later claim about content carries a measured
decomposition — ''lexicon / order / residual'' — and the placebo square regenerates that decomposition for
every new corpus free.

!!! The Parry-Lord signature ~ a rhythm that survives both nulls

Milman Parry and Albert Lord's oral-formulaic theory established that orally composed epic rides
''formulas'' — fixed phrase-units filling rhythmic slots — and that ''formulaic density MARKS oral composition,
measurably'' (Homer's epithets; and, as Beckwith's own commentary on the Kumulipo
details, Polynesian genealogical chant).

''The Kalākaua text — the 1889 printing closest to the oral Hawaiian original, least mediated by scholarly
prose — shows a rhythm component that survives BOTH nulls'': a pulse carried by sheer formula-saturation,
dense enough to outlast the scramble.

''The lock-quality hierarchy across renderings tracks distance from oral tradition exactly as a Parry-Lord
philologist would rank them blind:''

<<~ranks lock-quality kalakaua ~ 0.55 · the 1889 printing, least mediated -> liliuokalani ~ 0.38 -> beckwith ~ 0.30 · the scholarly rendering, furthest from the oral line>>

A clock-recovery loop knowing nothing of Homer or Hawaiʻi recovered the oral-composition signature from
sequence statistics alone.

!!! What this changes for the corpus work

''The wrapped corpus stays the right instrument for studying the notation itself'' — the finding names a
''dial to declare'', never a defect to fix. Corpus linguistics has long known markup contaminates corpus
statistics; what stands added here reads as a quantified, plane-wise ablation of that contamination with
the mechanism named. Statistical physics supplies the transition vocabulary: dominance on a measure-zero
slice of parameter space, structurally unstable, collapsing under infinitesimal perturbation.

''Provenance:'' harvested verbatim from the campaign scroll at `lar:///lares_research/the-kumulipo-test-campaign`,
whose bytes arrived torn from a terminal capture. The harvest repaired fused words and reconstructed no dropped
span. Three passages in the source carry gaps this harvest could not recover and did not invent.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/integration>>

!! Integration ~ the full model runs python + R, TS the functor floor + coordinator

The ''full sensorium model runs py/R'', instanced per-stream. The
heavy numerics AND the live stream-processing both ride ''holders'' in the drawer_io NDJSON style
(line-delimited JSON over stdio, the established holder contract); the FFZ-chronometer gate and the full
telemetry/metadata stamping fire ''py-side'', where the model reads. TS keeps the ''pure-functor math''
''floor'' — the mesh numerics — consumed BY the py sensorium, and stands as the ''coordinator'' that drives
the py-side instance and offloads to it. The batch bands sensorium already runs py/R; the streaming layer
''twins it py-side'', never re-homed into TS.

<<~ranks engine boundary ~ python — the per-chunk cosine-drift signal + ruptures (Binseg / KernelCPD) as the python changepoint fallback -> form ~ python — tree-sitter · tree-sitter-languages · prefixspan · c2xg · treeminer · spacy+benepar (or stanza) -> stats ~ a thin R leg — "ecp::e.divisive" (the boundary tree) + a bootstrap / jackknife reproduction grade -> induce ~ the `induce` job mines a corpus end-to-end; the STREAMING layer TWINS it py-side, a live per-stream instance running the SAME model>>

''The install carries the model, live and batch alike.'' Every dependency lands in the venv, and the venv
now homes the sensorium itself — the model reads py-side rather than behind TS:

<<~ranks install python-form ~ tree-sitter · tree-sitter-languages · prefixspan · c2xg · treeminer · spacy+benepar (or stanza) -> python-boundary ~ ruptures (changepoint) · the cosine-drift signal over content embeddings -> r-stats ~ ecp>>

<<~/ahu>>

