<<~Sprint S1 "name/bands cap ~ the grain address (FFZ membership tree) + the boundary tree R leg (ecp::e.divisive nested changepoints over content+form+structure, cosine-drift the signal) ~ ACCEPT: the grain address maps Pulse→Theme as containment LEVELS; a bootstrap reproduces the locked boundaries (resampling-consensus gate fires)">>
