<<~Sprint S3 "name/form cap ~ the induction holder (TreeMiner + PrefixSpan/BIDE + c2xg, EM-iterated, MDL-stopped) ~ ACCEPT: the `induce` batch surfaces templates that each pay their description-length; the LLM labels them AFTER mining, never inside the loop">>

